# Generated benchmark artifacts — exclude from diffs, GitHub language stats, and
# automated code review (Copilot skips linguist-generated + binary files). These are
# agent-produced outputs / measured data, not human-authored code.
# See commit0/AAR_2026-06-04_REVALIDATION.md and commit0/RE-VALIDATION.md.

# Per-cell result JSONs + aggregates + OpenHands run dirs (measured data)
commit0/results/**                 linguist-generated=true

# Agent-generated code diffs (provenance; e.g. chardet patch is ~41k lines of data tables).
# -text: never apply CRLF conversion — patches are stored byte-exact LF so `patch_sha256`
# verifies and `git apply` works on every platform (Windows autocrlf would otherwise
# corrupt them on checkout). See commit0/results/patches/README.md.
commit0/results/patches/**         -diff -text linguist-generated=true

# Rendered figure — only the vector PDF is tracked (the PNG raster is git-ignored;
# see .gitignore — it is regenerated locally to avoid ~1.2 MB binary blobs in history)
paper/figures/*.pdf                -diff linguist-generated=true
